sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Data Scientist
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API
    participant KServeCtrl as KServe Controller
    participant Storage as Cloud Storage<br/>(S3/GCS/Azure/HF)<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant KRBP as kube-rbac-proxy<br/>8443/TCP TLS
    participant AG as AutoGluon Server<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
    participant Model as AutoGluon Predictor<br/>(in-process)

    rect rgb(230, 245, 255)
        Note over User,Model: Flow 1: Model Loading at Startup
        User->>K8sAPI: kubectl apply InferenceService CR<br/>(modelFormat: autogluon)
        K8sAPI->>KServeCtrl: Watch event (InferenceService created)
        KServeCtrl->>KServeCtrl: Resolve ClusterServingRuntime<br/>for autogluon format
        KServeCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create Pod with autogluon-server image<br/>+ kube-rbac-proxy sidecar
        K8sAPI-->>AG: Pod starts, __main__.py runs
        AG->>AG: runtime_paths.py: probe writable dir<br/>(/tmp, $HOME, /home/kserve), chdir
        AG->>Storage: kserve-storage downloads model<br/>HTTPS/443, IAM/SA/Token auth
        Storage-->>AG: Model artifacts (TabularPredictor<br/>or TimeSeriesPredictor files)
        AG->>AG: predictor_detect.py: try TimeSeriesPredictor.load()<br/>fallback to TabularPredictor.load()
        AG->>AG: version_compat.py: check major.minor match<br/>(tolerates patch/local diffs like +rhaiv.3)
        AG->>Model: Load model into memory
        AG-->>K8sAPI: /v2/health/ready returns 200
    end

    rect rgb(255, 245, 230)
        Note over User,Model: Flow 2: Tabular Inference (V2 Open Inference Protocol)
        User->>KRBP: POST /v2/models/{name}/infer<br/>HTTPS/443, Bearer Token
        KRBP->>KRBP: Validate token via RBAC
        KRBP->>AG: Forward to localhost:8080<br/>HTTP (no encryption)
        AG->>AG: Decode V2 tensor payload<br/>Map integer column names to<br/>predictor feature names
        AG->>Model: AutoGluonTabularModel.predict()<br/>or predict_proba() if PREDICT_PROBA=true
        Model-->>AG: Prediction result (DataFrame)
        AG->>AG: Convert DataFrame to V2<br/>InferResponse tensor format
        AG-->>KRBP: JSON response
        KRBP-->>User: HTTPS response
    end

    rect rgb(230, 255, 230)
        Note over User,Model: Flow 3: Time Series Forecast (V1 Protocol)
        User->>KRBP: POST /v1/models/{name}:predict<br/>HTTPS/443, Bearer Token
        KRBP->>KRBP: Validate token via RBAC
        KRBP->>AG: Forward to localhost:8080<br/>HTTP (no encryption)
        AG->>AG: Parse V1 JSON payload<br/>(instances with id, timestamp,<br/>target, known_covariates)
        AG->>Model: AutoGluonTimeSeriesModel.predict()<br/>TimeSeriesPredictor.predict()
        Model-->>AG: Forecast DataFrame<br/>(mean, quantiles per item_id)
        AG->>AG: Convert forecast to V1<br/>JSON response
        AG-->>KRBP: JSON response
        KRBP-->>User: HTTPS response
    end
